flowchart TD
    mask --> nothing{Anything removed?}
    nothing -->|no| summary[Write a summary]
    nothing -->|yes| estimate[Estimate the size]
    estimate --> target{Over the target?}
    target -->|yes| summary
    target -->|no| keep[Keep the copy]
    keep -->|micro| line([Log line])
    summary -->|full| line
